  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The number of numbers, strictly between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5000</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10000</mn></math> can be formed using the digits <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></math> without repetition, is</p>",
